WEBVTT

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:22.621
Regeneration cycle incomplete.

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:30.669
When I checked
the overnight sensor logs,

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:33.211
this little surprise
was waiting for me.

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:35.406
Maybe I'm not quite awake,

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:39.110
but it looks like its
over 100 kilometers wide.

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:42.120
120. At first, I thought
it was an asteroid cluster

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:46.056
until I picked up
a residual warp signature.

00:03:46.125 --> 00:03:48.616
It was a Borg vessel.

00:03:48.695 --> 00:03:50.959
There are tetryon particles
in the debris consistent

00:03:51.064 --> 00:03:52.725
with the atmosphere
inside a cube.

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:54.494
Any idea what destroyed it?

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:56.967
We would need to run
close-range scans

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:58.435
of the hull fragments.

00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:00.665
Unless we alter course,
we'll get our chance.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.401
The debris field's
directly ahead.

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:04.102
Then I suggest
we cut a wide berth.

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:07.669
Chances are the Borg will send
more vessels to investigate.

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:09.237
Alter course
to avoid the debris.

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:10.407
If that's all...

00:04:10.483 --> 00:04:13.145
One other piece
of business, Captain.

00:04:13.219 --> 00:04:14.447
It seems we had another incident

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.578
in the Mess Hall last night.

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:17.555
Return of the midnight snacker?

00:04:17.624 --> 00:04:18.921
I'm afraid so.

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:20.150
Casualties?

00:04:20.226 --> 00:04:21.921
A leg of Kelaran wildebeest
I'd prepared

00:04:22.028 --> 00:04:23.689
for Ensign Ryson's birthday.

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.731
Since Commander Tuvok
has been unable

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:28.392
to round up any suspects,
I'd like to ask

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:30.129
that stronger measures be taken.

00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:31.864
Perhaps
an armed security detail...

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:33.872
I'd like to ask permission
to replicate

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.374
some locking mechanisms
for the cabinet doors.

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:37.466
Granted.

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:38.908
Dismissed.

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:31.494
Naomi Wildman,

00:05:31.564 --> 00:05:33.395
Subunit of Ensign
Samantha Wildman,

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:34.592
state your intentions.

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:36.032
I...

00:05:38.004 --> 00:05:39.528
Very well.
You leave me no choice

00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:42.233
but to report your activities
to the Captain.

00:05:42.308 --> 00:05:43.536
Please don't.

00:05:43.609 --> 00:05:45.702
I was just observing you.

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:47.177
Explain.

00:05:47.246 --> 00:05:49.578
Well, Neelix told
me that the Borg

00:05:49.649 --> 00:05:51.082
do a lot of things they do

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.811
because they're trying
to be perfect

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:54.910
and, even though you're
not really a drone anymore,

00:05:54.987 --> 00:05:56.318
you still try to be perfect.

00:05:56.389 --> 00:05:57.321
Don't you?

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:58.721
Correct.

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:00.554
Well, if I can learn
to be perfect, too,

00:06:00.626 --> 00:06:01.558
then Captain Janeway

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:03.322
will have to make me
her Bridge Assistant.

00:06:03.396 --> 00:06:05.694
No such rank exists
aboard this vessel.

00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:07.198
Not yet.

00:06:07.266 --> 00:06:10.724
And you hope to achieve
this goal by emulating me?

00:06:10.803 --> 00:06:12.065
Are you mad?

00:06:12.138 --> 00:06:14.106
No.
There are many on this crew

00:06:14.173 --> 00:06:16.232
that would benefit
from your example.

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:18.402
So you'll teach me.

00:06:18.478 --> 00:06:19.911
Your objective is admirable.

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:22.810
However, your neocortical
development is incomplete.

00:06:22.882 --> 00:06:25.817
You would require several
months of accelerated growth

00:06:25.885 --> 00:06:27.443
in a Borg maturation chamber.

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:30.921
Oh... I don't think
I like the sound of that.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.287
Then I suggest that yo...

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:43.330
- Hi.
- Hi.

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:46.236
I'm bored.
Let's do something fun.

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:47.499
Like what?

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:49.473
Swimming?

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:52.477
Oh, I'm not allowed
to go swimming without my mom.

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:54.445
Oh.

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:56.106
Do you like Kadis-Kot?

00:06:56.182 --> 00:06:57.410
Love it.

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:58.450
Come on.

00:07:02.021 --> 00:07:04.080
I'll be Bridge Assistant
for a while

00:07:04.157 --> 00:07:06.057
then, I'll be promoted
to Ensign.

00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:07.888
It'll be Lieutenant after that,

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.656
and by the time we reach
the Alpha Quadrant...

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.595
Captain Wildman.

00:07:14.367 --> 00:07:17.359
Green, grid 14-4.

00:07:17.437 --> 00:07:18.699
Kadis-Kot. I win.

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:21.437
You're really good at this game.

00:07:21.507 --> 00:07:22.872
You want a rematch?

00:07:22.942 --> 00:07:23.909
Sure.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:26.171
Captains don't have much time
to play, you know.

00:07:26.245 --> 00:07:27.473
That's okay.

00:07:27.547 --> 00:07:28.844
I'll be pretty busy by then.

00:07:28.915 --> 00:07:30.815
Want to hear the rules
of first contact?

00:07:30.883 --> 00:07:32.350
No.

00:07:32.418 --> 00:07:34.386
How about the suborders
of the Prime Directive?

00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:35.682
I know all 47 of them.

00:07:35.755 --> 00:07:37.916
You study too much, Naomi.

00:07:38.057 --> 00:07:40.025
Just like my brother.

00:07:40.092 --> 00:07:41.787
I didn't know you had a brother.

00:07:41.861 --> 00:07:43.328
Mm-hmm. 12 of them.

00:07:43.396 --> 00:07:44.385
Twelve?

00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:46.398
Nine older and three younger.

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:47.933
We play Kadis-Kot all the time.

00:07:48.034 --> 00:07:50.434
I only have my mom
and Neelix to play with...

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:51.902
when they're not working.

00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:53.529
You must get lonely.

00:07:53.606 --> 00:07:57.098
A little. You get used to it.

00:07:57.176 --> 00:07:58.370
You adapt.

00:07:58.444 --> 00:07:59.934
Adapt?

00:08:00.079 --> 00:08:01.706
You know, like the Borg.

00:08:01.781 --> 00:08:05.308
Borg... I hate Borgs.

00:08:05.384 --> 00:08:06.976
You do?

00:08:07.053 --> 00:08:08.884
Yeah. They're mean.

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:10.615
Torres to Seven of Nine.

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.453
Please report to Engineering.

00:08:12.525 --> 00:08:13.492
It's your move.

00:08:15.461 --> 00:08:17.793
Seven, respond.

00:08:20.933 --> 00:08:22.230
I'm on my way, Lieutenant.

00:08:23.836 --> 00:08:25.098
Naomi Wildman...

00:08:25.171 --> 00:08:26.763
Yes?

00:08:26.839 --> 00:08:28.739
What am I doing here?

00:08:28.808 --> 00:08:31.504
We're playing Kadis-Kot.

00:08:33.846 --> 00:08:35.177
Seven?

00:08:50.062 --> 00:08:52.030
Take a look at this, will you?

00:08:52.098 --> 00:08:56.057
I'm picking up an energy signal
in the lower subspace bands

00:08:56.135 --> 00:08:59.229
and if I'm not mistaken,
it's got a Borg modulation.

00:08:59.305 --> 00:09:00.533
You're correct.

00:09:00.606 --> 00:09:01.868
It is Borg.

00:09:02.008 --> 00:09:04.272
I believe it's
a neural interlink frequency.

00:09:04.343 --> 00:09:05.435
A what?

00:09:05.511 --> 00:09:08.912
A frequency that integrates
the minds of Borg drones.

00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:12.244
Can you pinpoint the origin?

00:09:12.318 --> 00:09:13.683
I will try.

00:09:15.388 --> 00:09:18.983
No offense, Seven,
but you look terrible.

00:09:19.058 --> 00:09:20.548
I am not well.

00:09:20.626 --> 00:09:22.719
I experienced
a brief lapse in memory

00:09:22.795 --> 00:09:24.353
and I am disoriented.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:25.829
Maybe you should
get to Sick Bay.

00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:27.297
No.

00:09:27.366 --> 00:09:29.061
This interlink frequency
could explain m...

00:09:40.413 --> 00:09:42.677
Do-raQ me'roch.

00:09:42.748 --> 00:09:44.340
I beg your pardon?

00:09:45.484 --> 00:09:48.044
I am the son of K'Vok.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.144
And you?

00:09:49.221 --> 00:09:50.620
What house are you from?

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.783
Is this some kind of a joke?

00:09:52.858 --> 00:09:56.919
You wear the uniform
of a Starfleet puH-chaH.

00:09:57.029 --> 00:09:59.862
What kind of a warrior are you?

00:09:59.932 --> 00:10:02.264
Tom put you up to this,
didn't he?

00:10:02.335 --> 00:10:03.768
Well, it didn't work.

00:10:07.173 --> 00:10:08.834
Come, warrior,
let me look at you.

00:10:08.908 --> 00:10:10.398
Enough, Seven.

00:10:11.611 --> 00:10:12.737
Your blood is sweet!

00:10:16.749 --> 00:10:17.681
Torres to Security.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.479
Get somebody down here
right now.

00:10:19.552 --> 00:10:21.042
You are strong.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.451
You will make an excellent mate.

00:10:22.521 --> 00:10:24.352
Get the hell away from me!

00:10:24.423 --> 00:10:26.857
You wish to prove yourself
in battle.

00:10:34.166 --> 00:10:35.394
Report.

00:10:35.468 --> 00:10:37.698
Seven of Nine attacked
B'Elanna in Engineering.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.328
She's on Deck 9, Section 23.

00:10:39.405 --> 00:10:40.804
Force fields.

00:10:40.873 --> 00:10:43.171
Don't tell me those two
have actually come to blows.

00:10:49.115 --> 00:10:51.106
Bridge to Tuvok.

00:10:51.183 --> 00:10:54.846
Seven's been contained...
Deck 10, Section 32.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.852
Acknowledged.

00:10:55.921 --> 00:10:57.183
We're nearing her position.

00:11:00.459 --> 00:11:02.984
Seven?

00:11:04.497 --> 00:11:06.590
Somebody's hurt
and he needs help.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.931
Did I do something bad?

00:11:13.005 --> 00:11:14.836
Who are you?

00:11:14.907 --> 00:11:17.273
My name's Maryl.

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:19.903
Are you a Vulcan?

00:11:19.979 --> 00:11:23.437
Computer,
deactivate force field.

00:11:28.554 --> 00:11:29.782
Give me the phaser.

00:11:38.097 --> 00:11:39.894
You are not a physician,
Commander.

00:11:39.965 --> 00:11:41.830
The logical course of action

00:11:41.901 --> 00:11:44.961
would be to take him
to the infirmary.

00:11:45.104 --> 00:11:46.969
Maryl?

00:11:47.106 --> 00:11:49.734
Subaltern Lorot,
Vulcan High Command.

00:11:49.809 --> 00:11:51.470
May I be of assistance?

00:11:51.544 --> 00:11:52.772
Yes.

00:11:52.845 --> 00:11:55.473
Please accompany me to Sick Bay.

00:11:55.548 --> 00:11:58.108
Certainly.

00:11:58.184 --> 00:11:59.583
Clearly he was attacked.

00:11:59.652 --> 00:12:02.052
I suggest we use caution.

00:12:04.623 --> 00:12:06.056
Pahtk!

00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:10.061
You will drown
in your own blood.

00:12:10.129 --> 00:12:12.029
Keep moving.

00:12:28.147 --> 00:12:30.172
Seven?

00:12:30.249 --> 00:12:32.513
Captain, why am I here?

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:34.382
You've been unconscious
for nearly two hours.

00:12:34.453 --> 00:12:38.082
We believe you're experiencing
a neurological disorder.

00:12:38.157 --> 00:12:40.625
Voices... I hear voices...

00:12:40.693 --> 00:12:41.625
Describe them.

00:12:42.795 --> 00:12:44.956
They are agitated...

00:12:45.097 --> 00:12:48.260
chaotic...

00:12:48.334 --> 00:12:49.892
too many voices.

00:13:01.747 --> 00:13:03.476
Too many voices!

00:13:04.817 --> 00:13:08.719
The cortical inhibitor
is destabilizing.

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:12.554
I'm increasing the
neurotransmitter levels.

00:13:12.625 --> 00:13:14.422
It's working.

00:13:14.493 --> 00:13:16.358
Do you still hear the voices?

00:13:16.428 --> 00:13:18.191
They are fading.

00:13:20.933 --> 00:13:23.731
They are gone.

00:13:23.803 --> 00:13:25.566
All right.
Let's see what we can do

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:27.128
to keep them from coming back.

00:13:27.206 --> 00:13:29.037
What's the last thing
you remember?

00:13:30.976 --> 00:13:33.911
I was in Engineering
assisting Lieutenant Torres.

00:13:33.979 --> 00:13:35.412
You have no recollection

00:13:35.481 --> 00:13:37.540
of a confrontation
with B'Elanna?

00:13:37.616 --> 00:13:38.548
Confrontation?

00:13:38.617 --> 00:13:39.606
I'm not sure why,

00:13:39.685 --> 00:13:41.676
but you seem to be manifesting

00:13:41.754 --> 00:13:44.052
personalities
other than your own.

00:13:44.123 --> 00:13:46.956
Naomi Wildman claims
the two of you played together

00:13:47.059 --> 00:13:48.959
for nearly an hour
this afternoon.

00:13:49.028 --> 00:13:51.053
You also attacked
Lieutenant Torres.

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.758
She told us you called
yourself "son of K'Vok"

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:56.563
and that you initiated
a Klingon mating ritual.

00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:59.262
I have no memory
of those events.

00:13:59.338 --> 00:14:00.669
Come look at this.

00:14:00.739 --> 00:14:01.831
Doctor?

00:14:01.907 --> 00:14:04.273
This is your neural pattern.

00:14:04.343 --> 00:14:06.903
The memory engrams
and synaptic pathways

00:14:07.046 --> 00:14:09.207
that define you
as an individual.

00:14:09.281 --> 00:14:11.340
Unfortunately, you're not alone.

00:14:11.417 --> 00:14:13.715
13 new neural patterns
have emerged

00:14:13.786 --> 00:14:15.310
in your cerebral cortex...

00:14:15.387 --> 00:14:18.823
Klingon, Vulcan,
Terrelian, human

00:14:18.891 --> 00:14:20.415
and several others
I can't identify.

00:14:20.492 --> 00:14:21.424
How?

00:14:21.493 --> 00:14:23.085
They're coming
from within you.

00:14:23.162 --> 00:14:24.493
During your time
with the Borg,

00:14:24.563 --> 00:14:27.123
the collective assimilated
hundreds of different species.

00:14:27.199 --> 00:14:29.190
All of those neural patterns
were integrated

00:14:29.268 --> 00:14:30.462
into the hive mind.

00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:31.525
Of course.

00:14:31.604 --> 00:14:34.232
That means
they're in your mind, too,

00:14:34.306 --> 00:14:36.638
stored
within your cortical implants...

00:14:36.709 --> 00:14:38.142
dormant until now.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.370
From what we can tell,

00:14:39.445 --> 00:14:42.346
the various neural patterns
are surfacing randomly.

00:14:42.414 --> 00:14:45.281
In essence, you've developed
the Borg equivalent

00:14:45.351 --> 00:14:47.319
of multiple personality
disorder.

00:14:48.387 --> 00:14:50.947
Can you correct
the malfunction?

00:14:51.023 --> 00:14:53.685
The cortical inhibitor
is suppressing the effect,

00:14:53.759 --> 00:14:55.693
but it's only
a temporary measure.

00:14:56.896 --> 00:14:59.956
Lieutenant Torres detected
a Borg interlink frequency.

00:15:00.032 --> 00:15:00.964
It could be causing

00:15:01.033 --> 00:15:02.557
my cortical implants
to malfunction.

00:15:02.635 --> 00:15:04.068
The signal appears
to be emanating

00:15:04.136 --> 00:15:06.263
from the Borg debris field
we discovered this morning.

00:15:06.338 --> 00:15:08.670
Maybe we should jump to warp...
try to get out of range.

00:15:08.741 --> 00:15:10.436
The signal permeates subspace.

00:15:10.509 --> 00:15:11.635
We cannot avoid it.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:13.678
Our only hope is
to terminate the signal

00:15:13.746 --> 00:15:14.906
at its point of origin.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.278
Set a course for
the debris field.

00:15:17.349 --> 00:15:19.613
When we arrive,
we may need your help.

00:15:19.685 --> 00:15:20.913
Feel up to it?

00:15:21.053 --> 00:15:22.486
Yes, Captain.

00:15:22.554 --> 00:15:24.351
Keep a close eye on her, Doctor,

00:15:24.423 --> 00:15:27.187
in case she has any more
unexpected visitors.

00:15:34.633 --> 00:15:36.498
Has any drone ever
experienced symptoms

00:15:36.568 --> 00:15:37.535
like these before?

00:15:37.603 --> 00:15:39.833
The collective does not
tolerate imperfection.

00:15:39.905 --> 00:15:42.237
Any drone with a malfunction
as serious as mine

00:15:42.308 --> 00:15:43.798
would be destroyed immediately.

00:15:43.876 --> 00:15:46.777
Lucky for you, this crew
is a little more tolerant.

00:15:46.845 --> 00:15:48.176
Oh, there you are.

00:15:48.247 --> 00:15:51.182
Lieutenant Torres tells me
you're under the weather.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:52.512
Correct.

00:15:52.584 --> 00:15:53.642
Well, is there anything

00:15:53.719 --> 00:15:55.448
your morale officer
can do to help?

00:15:55.521 --> 00:15:58.183
Assignments you need me to
finish while you recuperate?

00:15:58.257 --> 00:15:59.349
No.

00:15:59.425 --> 00:16:01.256
I have some wonderful
medicinal teas.

00:16:01.327 --> 00:16:03.056
Maybe I could
prepare one for you.

00:16:03.128 --> 00:16:04.117
Talaxian homeopathy.

00:16:04.196 --> 00:16:06.494
I don't think we're quite
that desperate yet.

00:16:06.565 --> 00:16:08.590
How about if I make one of
your favorite nutritional?

00:16:08.667 --> 00:16:10.362
Your concern has been noted.

00:16:10.436 --> 00:16:12.597
The Doctor will inform you
when I am functional again.

00:16:12.671 --> 00:16:14.229
Right. Sorry.

00:16:14.306 --> 00:16:16.900
Oh, uh...
I almost forgot...

00:16:16.976 --> 00:16:18.910
it's from Naomi Wildman.

00:16:20.846 --> 00:16:22.108
It's a drawing of Voyager.

00:16:23.549 --> 00:16:25.073
Or maybe it's an asteroid belt.

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:27.550
I'm not sure.

00:16:27.619 --> 00:16:30.144
Naomi thought that it
might make you feel better.

00:16:31.657 --> 00:16:33.648
Tell her thank you.

00:16:45.871 --> 00:16:47.270
I suspected as much.

00:16:47.339 --> 00:16:51.366
There were several interruptions
in your regeneration cycle.

00:16:51.443 --> 00:16:53.911
18 minutes,
five minutes, one hour.

00:16:53.979 --> 00:16:55.742
I don't recall them.

00:16:55.814 --> 00:16:57.873
Let's examine
your neural function logs.

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:00.111
Low serotonin levels
during regeneration.

00:17:00.185 --> 00:17:01.447
That's normal.

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:04.353
But look at these spikes
in the prefrontal synapses.

00:17:04.423 --> 00:17:07.221
They appear only seconds
before you left the alcove.

00:17:07.292 --> 00:17:08.452
You were sleepwalking.

00:17:08.527 --> 00:17:10.791
I don't remember entering
this data file.

00:17:10.863 --> 00:17:14.026
Looks like we found the identity
of the midnight snacker.

00:17:14.099 --> 00:17:16.090
I'm sure Mr. Neelix
will be relieved.

00:17:16.168 --> 00:17:21.231
Personal Log, Ensign Stone,
Stardate 52188.7.

00:17:21.306 --> 00:17:23.467
I just completed my first week
of active duty.

00:17:23.542 --> 00:17:24.804
It was a nightmare.

00:17:24.877 --> 00:17:26.401
After four years at the Academy,

00:17:26.478 --> 00:17:28.241
I thought
I was ready for anything,

00:17:28.313 --> 00:17:30.440
but Captain Blackwood
runs a tight ship

00:17:30.516 --> 00:17:32.484
and he seems to take
special pleasure

00:17:32.551 --> 00:17:33.916
in tormenting new recruits.

00:17:34.019 --> 00:17:36.783
The First Officer tells me
not to take it personally,

00:17:36.855 --> 00:17:38.823
but it's hard
to be objective when...

00:17:38.891 --> 00:17:40.324
Blackwood.

00:17:40.392 --> 00:17:43.691
Captain of the Federation
Starship Tombaugh.

00:17:43.762 --> 00:17:47.220
The Borg assimilated
that vessel 13 years ago.

00:17:47.299 --> 00:17:49.733
The individual who made
this recording

00:17:49.802 --> 00:17:52.100
must have been a member
of the crew.

00:17:52.171 --> 00:17:53.638
One of my victims.

00:17:53.705 --> 00:17:55.400
Here's another log entry...

00:17:55.474 --> 00:17:57.465
this one encoded
for transmission.

00:17:57.543 --> 00:17:59.807
Hi. Guess who?

00:17:59.878 --> 00:18:02.403
I know I promised
to write you every day,

00:18:02.481 --> 00:18:04.073
but that's simply not enough.

00:18:04.149 --> 00:18:06.379
How about once in the morning
when I resuscitate

00:18:06.452 --> 00:18:08.317
and once at night
before I go into torpor

00:18:08.387 --> 00:18:11.515
and I'll think about you
nonstop in between.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:12.648
Wait. I've got a better idea.

00:18:12.724 --> 00:18:15.318
Why don't you leave your circle
and visit the colony?

00:18:15.394 --> 00:18:16.793
You'd love it here... sul...

00:18:16.862 --> 00:18:18.227
Anything familiar?

00:18:18.297 --> 00:18:21.630
I helped to assimilate
thousands of individuals.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.327
I do not remember
each of their names.

00:18:23.402 --> 00:18:25.893
Seven, you were a Borg drone

00:18:26.038 --> 00:18:27.801
who's now becoming
an individual.

00:18:27.873 --> 00:18:29.397
That's practically unheard of.

00:18:29.475 --> 00:18:33.036
There's bound to be rough
spots along the way.

00:18:33.112 --> 00:18:35.410
We just have to get past them.

00:18:35.481 --> 00:18:37.244
Bridge to Seven of Nine.

00:18:37.316 --> 00:18:38.908
We're approaching
the debris field.

00:18:38.984 --> 00:18:40.315
Acknowledged.

00:18:47.126 --> 00:18:48.286
Survivors?

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:49.486
None.

00:18:49.561 --> 00:18:50.858
Any sign of Borg vessels?

00:18:50.929 --> 00:18:51.861
No, sir.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:53.329
We're the first ones here.

00:18:53.398 --> 00:18:54.797
I'm picking up the source

00:18:54.867 --> 00:18:57.563
of the interlink frequency,
bearing 027 mark 3.

00:18:57.636 --> 00:18:58.694
On screen.

00:19:00.672 --> 00:19:02.606
Magnify.

00:19:02.674 --> 00:19:04.608
It's a Borg vinculum.

00:19:04.676 --> 00:19:07.338
Vinculum?

00:19:07.412 --> 00:19:08.743
The processing device

00:19:08.814 --> 00:19:10.873
at the core
of every Borg vessel.

00:19:11.016 --> 00:19:13.541
It interconnects
the minds of all the drones.

00:19:13.619 --> 00:19:15.109
It purges individual thoughts

00:19:15.187 --> 00:19:18.122
and disseminates information
relevant to the collective.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.521
It brings order to chaos.

00:19:19.591 --> 00:19:20.853
Precisely.

00:19:20.926 --> 00:19:23.292
Looks like this one
has established a link

00:19:23.362 --> 00:19:24.795
to your cortical implant.

00:19:24.863 --> 00:19:27.889
I believe it has identified me
as an errant drone.

00:19:28.033 --> 00:19:28.897
It is attempting

00:19:29.034 --> 00:19:30.899
to reintegrate me
into the collective.

00:19:31.036 --> 00:19:32.697
The vinculum is malfunctioning.

00:19:32.771 --> 00:19:34.602
It is sending me
erratic commands.

00:19:34.673 --> 00:19:37.574
Bringing chaos to order.

00:19:39.011 --> 00:19:40.273
Yes.

00:19:40.345 --> 00:19:41.903
Can you sever the link?

00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:45.381
Not without risking permanent
damage to my own systems.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.645
The vinculum must be
taken off-line.

00:19:47.719 --> 00:19:50.847
Permission to beam it aboard
for analysis.

00:19:50.923 --> 00:19:53.790
I have worked with
this technology before.

00:19:53.859 --> 00:19:55.451
I may be able to disable it.

00:19:55.527 --> 00:19:58.496
We're talking about
the heart of a Borg cube.

00:19:58.564 --> 00:20:01.089
I'd rather not take it
inside my ship.

00:20:01.166 --> 00:20:03.100
Can you disable it remotely?

00:20:03.168 --> 00:20:04.658
Yes, but I would need
several days.

00:20:04.736 --> 00:20:06.033
The Borg may return by then.

00:20:06.104 --> 00:20:08.834
I recommend we take the vinculum

00:20:08.907 --> 00:20:11.899
and leave this region
immediately.

00:20:15.113 --> 00:20:17.308
Tuvok, prepare to beam it
to Engineering.

00:20:17.382 --> 00:20:18.906
Erect a level-10 force field

00:20:18.984 --> 00:20:20.884
and maintain constant
surveillance.

00:20:20.953 --> 00:20:23.820
The moment it poses a threat,
send it back into space.

00:20:23.889 --> 00:20:27.086
Tom, as soon a it's aboard,
get us out of here, warp 9.

00:20:27.159 --> 00:20:28.592
Aye, Captain.

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.491
I understand
what you're going through

00:20:30.562 --> 00:20:32.621
and I want to help you
in every way I can,

00:20:32.698 --> 00:20:35.496
but the safety of this crew
is my first responsibility.

00:20:35.567 --> 00:20:38.695
We haven't had the best
of luck with the Borg.

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.863
Nor have I.

00:20:47.579 --> 00:20:49.513
Let's keep on eye
on those antigrav struts.

00:20:49.581 --> 00:20:51.981
Boylan, lock out
all primary command consoles

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:55.383
and reroute transporter controls
to Main Engineering.

00:20:55.454 --> 00:20:57.251
Yes, Lieutenant.

00:21:00.392 --> 00:21:02.087
Seven?

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.788
The voices, I hear them.

00:21:04.863 --> 00:21:06.888
It's your proximity
to the vinculum.

00:21:06.965 --> 00:21:08.398
The link is stronger here.

00:21:08.467 --> 00:21:10.935
I'm adjusting your
neurotransmitter levels.

00:21:12.404 --> 00:21:14.497
We better get started.

00:21:21.713 --> 00:21:23.442
Don't worry, Lieutenant.

00:21:23.515 --> 00:21:26.416
The son of K'Vok
will not be joining us.

00:21:26.485 --> 00:21:27.918
Glad to hear it.

00:21:27.986 --> 00:21:30.614
Does this qualify
as our second date?

00:21:30.689 --> 00:21:33.180
Just think of me
as your chaperon.

00:21:33.258 --> 00:21:34.520
So...

00:21:34.593 --> 00:21:36.151
where's the off switch?

00:21:36.228 --> 00:21:39.129
The vinculum is equipped
with many safeguards.

00:21:39.197 --> 00:21:41.461
I will need to access
its transneural matrix

00:21:41.533 --> 00:21:42.830
and disable it directly.

00:21:45.103 --> 00:21:46.695
I'm reading a power surge.

00:21:46.772 --> 00:21:49.297
It's a normal response
to my intrusion.

00:21:49.374 --> 00:21:50.500
Don't be alarmed.

00:21:52.044 --> 00:21:53.807
Curious...

00:21:53.879 --> 00:21:56.439
I'm detecting an organism
within the vinculum.

00:21:56.515 --> 00:21:58.415
It appears to be a viral agent.

00:21:58.483 --> 00:21:59.450
Let's see it.

00:22:01.119 --> 00:22:02.916
It's a synthetic pathogen.

00:22:02.988 --> 00:22:05.479
The virus was originally
a biological agent,

00:22:05.557 --> 00:22:06.524
but it's mutated.

00:22:06.591 --> 00:22:08.491
It's attacking
the vinculum's programs

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:09.788
as it would living cells.

00:22:09.861 --> 00:22:12.421
An organism
that attacks technology?

00:22:12.497 --> 00:22:14.488
The cube was infected
three days ago,

00:22:14.566 --> 00:22:17.262
shortly after assimilating
an alien shuttlecraft.

00:22:18.737 --> 00:22:21.069
Species 6339.

00:22:21.139 --> 00:22:23.403
They were the last ones to come
in contact with the cube.

00:22:23.475 --> 00:22:25.636
Looks like we've found
our Typhoid Mary.

00:22:30.682 --> 00:22:34.345
Species 6339, humanoid.
Warp-capable.

00:22:34.419 --> 00:22:38.549
Origin: Grid 124,
Octant 22-Theta.

00:22:38.623 --> 00:22:39.817
They first encountered
the Borg

00:22:39.891 --> 00:22:40.949
approximately four years ago.

00:22:41.093 --> 00:22:43.061
Since that time,
11 billion individuals

00:22:43.128 --> 00:22:44.618
have been assimilated.

00:22:44.696 --> 00:22:46.789
Three days ago,
the collective detected

00:22:46.865 --> 00:22:48.958
one of their last
surviving shuttlecraft.

00:22:49.067 --> 00:22:50.432
A cube was sent
to intercept it.

00:22:50.502 --> 00:22:53.266
We believe the virus
was carried within their bodies.

00:22:53.338 --> 00:22:56.068
Once they were assimilated,
it spread to the vinculum.

00:22:56.141 --> 00:22:57.836
The drones aboard no doubt

00:22:57.909 --> 00:23:00.537
experienced symptoms
similar to my own.

00:23:00.612 --> 00:23:03.706
It is no surprise
they destroyed themselves.

00:23:03.782 --> 00:23:06.580
I'd like to find Species 6339.

00:23:06.651 --> 00:23:09.142
They may be able
to help us treat you.

00:23:09.221 --> 00:23:11.348
Begin long-range
astrometric scans.

00:23:11.423 --> 00:23:13.448
See if they have any more
vessels in this region.

00:23:13.525 --> 00:23:14.457
Yes, Captain.

00:23:14.526 --> 00:23:16.255
I've already begun
a spatial diag...

00:23:21.333 --> 00:23:26.635
My... My, my.
Look at the size of that thing.

00:23:26.705 --> 00:23:27.694
This viewscreen.

00:23:27.773 --> 00:23:30.207
It's got to be one
of the biggest I've ever seen.

00:23:30.275 --> 00:23:32.766
I'll give you
20 bars of latinum for it.

00:23:32.844 --> 00:23:34.869
I think the inhibitor's
gone off-line.

00:23:34.946 --> 00:23:36.311
Would you come here, please?

00:23:36.381 --> 00:23:38.781
Be quiet. Can't you see
I'm in the middle of a deal?

00:23:40.452 --> 00:23:43.216
Name your price, Captain?

00:23:43.288 --> 00:23:45.313
Janeway, and you are?

00:23:45.390 --> 00:23:47.381
Daimon Torrot.

00:23:47.459 --> 00:23:48.721
You're Ferengi.

00:23:48.794 --> 00:23:49.886
Of course I'm Ferengi.

00:23:49.961 --> 00:23:53.260
Is that some kind of insult
about the size of my ears?

00:23:53.331 --> 00:23:54.423
No, not at all.

00:23:54.499 --> 00:23:56.660
I'd be happy to
negotiate with you,

00:23:56.735 --> 00:23:58.760
but, first, we have
to get you to Sick Bay.

00:23:58.837 --> 00:24:00.464
Sick Bay?
What for?

00:24:00.539 --> 00:24:02.598
Because... you're ill.

00:24:02.674 --> 00:24:04.801
I've never felt better.

00:24:04.876 --> 00:24:06.173
Doctor.

00:24:06.244 --> 00:24:08.269
I'm afraid you've contracted

00:24:08.346 --> 00:24:10.746
a nasty strain
of the Ankaran flu.

00:24:10.816 --> 00:24:14.252
We've been treating you
several days. Remember?

00:24:14.319 --> 00:24:15.911
No.

00:24:16.054 --> 00:24:18.318
Short-term memory loss...
it's one of the symptoms.

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:20.017
Don't worry. It isn't
life-threatening,

00:24:20.091 --> 00:24:21.922
but we'll need to treat you...
in Sick Bay.

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:25.188
What is this treatment
going to cost me?

00:24:25.263 --> 00:24:26.855
It's free of charge.

00:24:26.932 --> 00:24:27.921
Free?

00:24:28.066 --> 00:24:29.328
Yes.

00:24:29.401 --> 00:24:31.494
You know, I have been having
a nagging pain

00:24:31.570 --> 00:24:33.800
in my lower left lobe,
and while you're at it

00:24:33.872 --> 00:24:36.363
why don't you run a complete
tricardial diagnostic?

00:24:36.441 --> 00:24:37.931
The Ferengi Health Commission

00:24:38.009 --> 00:24:41.035
is trying to revoke
my trading license.

00:24:41.112 --> 00:24:43.410
Impressive vessel,
Captain. Galaxy-class?

00:24:43.482 --> 00:24:44.744
Intrepid.

00:24:44.816 --> 00:24:45.942
Ah. Ah! And here we are

00:24:46.051 --> 00:24:47.882
in the much talked
about "Sick Bay."

00:24:47.953 --> 00:24:50.945
Not exactly state
of the medical art now, is it?

00:24:51.022 --> 00:24:52.148
What do you mean?

00:24:52.224 --> 00:24:53.282
Low on bio-beds,

00:24:53.358 --> 00:24:54.484
terrible lighting,

00:24:54.559 --> 00:24:56.493
obsolete instruments.

00:24:56.561 --> 00:24:58.825
Lucky for you, I know
a medical supplier

00:24:58.897 --> 00:25:01.491
that can spruce this place up
in a nanosecond

00:25:01.566 --> 00:25:04.831
and I'll even drop my commission
to a mere... 30 percent?

00:25:04.903 --> 00:25:06.165
How generous of you.

00:25:06.238 --> 00:25:07.899
Computer, activate force field.

00:25:07.973 --> 00:25:10.305
Force field?
You said I wasn't contagious.

00:25:10.375 --> 00:25:11.842
It's for your own safety.

00:25:11.910 --> 00:25:13.844
I set the cortical
inhibitor to maximum...

00:25:13.912 --> 00:25:15.174
I've been kidnapped!

00:25:15.247 --> 00:25:16.737
But it is no longer
suppressing the effect.

00:25:16.815 --> 00:25:17.747
These personalities...

00:25:18.817 --> 00:25:20.148
are going to keep surfacing.

00:25:20.218 --> 00:25:22.709
All the more reason to shut down
the vinculum as soon as we can.

00:25:22.787 --> 00:25:24.687
Even if we do break the
link, it may be too late.

00:25:24.756 --> 00:25:26.417
Seven's own neural pattern
is destabilizing.

00:25:26.491 --> 00:25:27.480
It could be lost.

00:25:27.559 --> 00:25:29.652
Please help me.

00:25:29.728 --> 00:25:30.888
I'm looking for my son...

00:25:30.962 --> 00:25:32.793
Gregory Bergan,
Lieutenant Bergan.

00:25:32.864 --> 00:25:33.853
Have you seen him?

00:25:33.932 --> 00:25:35.331
No, I'm afraid not.

00:25:35.400 --> 00:25:37.527
From the Starship Melbourne.

00:25:37.602 --> 00:25:38.864
Melbourne...

00:25:38.937 --> 00:25:42.464
I was supposed
to meet him at Wolf 359,

00:25:42.541 --> 00:25:44.566
but Starfleet sent out a warning

00:25:44.643 --> 00:25:46.838
that the Borg were
attacking that sector.

00:25:46.912 --> 00:25:49.142
It was too late
for us to turn back.

00:25:49.214 --> 00:25:51.182
We were caught
in a terrible battle.

00:25:51.249 --> 00:25:52.910
My ship was badly damaged.

00:25:52.984 --> 00:25:54.952
We had to leave on escape pods.

00:25:55.086 --> 00:25:57.953
I never found out
what happened to Gregory.

00:25:58.023 --> 00:26:01.459
Please, I haven't heard from him
in over three days.

00:26:01.526 --> 00:26:05.257
Could you check
with Starfleet Headquarters?

00:26:05.330 --> 00:26:08.424
I'll see what I can do.

00:26:08.500 --> 00:26:10.559
Thank you, Captain.

00:26:10.635 --> 00:26:13.001
Lf... if you do speak with him,

00:26:13.071 --> 00:26:15.767
could you tell him that
his mother is all right

00:26:15.840 --> 00:26:17.501
and if he could pos?

00:26:21.279 --> 00:26:22.746
Captain...

00:26:22.814 --> 00:26:24.179
Seven?

00:26:25.216 --> 00:26:26.513
Yes.

00:26:26.585 --> 00:26:28.109
The vinculum...

00:26:28.186 --> 00:26:30.177
We're preparing
to shut it down right away.

00:26:30.255 --> 00:26:32.485
I'll give the order
as soon as Torres is ready.

00:26:33.592 --> 00:26:36.288
How long was I... absent?

00:26:36.361 --> 00:26:38.192
About 20 minutes.

00:26:38.263 --> 00:26:39.389
How many?

00:26:39.464 --> 00:26:40.726
Two.

00:26:40.799 --> 00:26:44.929
One of whom wanted to acquire
half the items on the ship.

00:26:45.070 --> 00:26:47.095
DaiMon Torrot, I believe.

00:26:48.173 --> 00:26:50.073
Species 180, Ferengi.

00:26:50.141 --> 00:26:52.439
Yes. The other was a woman

00:26:52.510 --> 00:26:55.775
whose son was lost
in a Borg attack.

00:26:55.847 --> 00:26:58.611
You'll get through this, Seven.

00:26:58.683 --> 00:27:01.311
I do not share your optimism.

00:27:04.222 --> 00:27:06.247
When you took me from the Borg

00:27:06.324 --> 00:27:09.054
and began to turn me
into an individual,

00:27:09.127 --> 00:27:11.493
I found the silence
of my own mind

00:27:11.563 --> 00:27:12.860
difficult to bear.

00:27:14.899 --> 00:27:17.891
I missed the voices
of the collective.

00:27:17.969 --> 00:27:23.839
But now that I am an individual
those same voices...

00:27:23.908 --> 00:27:25.205
frighten me.

00:27:27.979 --> 00:27:29.412
Captain, I don't know

00:27:29.481 --> 00:27:32.507
if I can tolerate
this condition much longer.

00:27:32.584 --> 00:27:36.384
My courage is insufficient.

00:27:38.590 --> 00:27:41.115
Your job is to keep trying...

00:27:41.192 --> 00:27:45.219
to hold on, even when
you think you can't.

00:27:45.296 --> 00:27:48.561
Leave the rest
to me and the crew.

00:28:02.213 --> 00:28:04.477
Meet anyone interesting?

00:28:04.549 --> 00:28:07.518
Just finished swapping jokes
with a Bolian manicurist.

00:28:07.585 --> 00:28:09.018
Before that, I was debating

00:28:09.087 --> 00:28:12.488
the finer points of temporal
physics with a Krenim scientist.

00:28:12.557 --> 00:28:14.491
12 new personalities
have surfaced

00:28:14.559 --> 00:28:15.924
in the past hour alone.

00:28:18.563 --> 00:28:20.292
Seven's having
a rough time of it.

00:28:20.365 --> 00:28:21.832
The Doctor had to sedate her.

00:28:21.900 --> 00:28:23.492
And how's
the Captain holding up?

00:28:23.568 --> 00:28:26.162
I've been better, Chakotay.

00:28:26.237 --> 00:28:28.831
In fact...

00:28:28.907 --> 00:28:30.204
I'm starting to wonder

00:28:30.275 --> 00:28:32.641
if my first officer
was right all along.

00:28:32.711 --> 00:28:33.905
About what?

00:28:33.978 --> 00:28:37.345
You always said that
bringing Seven into the fold

00:28:37.415 --> 00:28:38.848
might be impossible.

00:28:38.917 --> 00:28:42.580
"You can take the Borg
out of the collective, but..."

00:28:43.655 --> 00:28:45.179
I don't believe that.

00:28:45.256 --> 00:28:46.848
Not anymore.

00:28:46.925 --> 00:28:50.656
I didn't think she'd last
a day, much less a year.

00:28:50.729 --> 00:28:53.027
I'd say you've proven me wrong.

00:28:53.098 --> 00:28:54.224
Torres to Bridge.

00:28:54.299 --> 00:28:56.665
We're ready to begin
disabling the vinculum.

00:28:56.735 --> 00:28:57.895
Proceed.

00:28:59.971 --> 00:29:01.871
Target the transneural matrix.

00:29:01.940 --> 00:29:04.465
Stand by to initiate
the dampening field

00:29:04.542 --> 00:29:05.804
on my mark.

00:29:05.877 --> 00:29:08.141
Three, two, one.

00:29:08.213 --> 00:29:10.374
Mark.

00:29:13.551 --> 00:29:15.451
Its power output is dropping.

00:29:17.956 --> 00:29:19.821
Doctor to Bridge.
It seems to be working.

00:29:19.891 --> 00:29:21.449
Her neural pattern
is stabilizing.

00:29:24.229 --> 00:29:26.823
Power output
is down to 77 percent.

00:29:26.898 --> 00:29:29.162
71 percent...

00:29:29.234 --> 00:29:30.496
Wait a second.

00:29:30.568 --> 00:29:32.502
It's increasing.

00:29:32.570 --> 00:29:34.697
I am refocusing the
dampening field.

00:29:34.773 --> 00:29:36.832
It's still increasing.

00:29:36.908 --> 00:29:40.435
The vinculum is rerouting
its internal circuitry.

00:29:40.512 --> 00:29:41.672
It's adapting.

00:29:42.747 --> 00:29:43.679
PuH-chaH me'roQ!

00:29:44.749 --> 00:29:45.681
Engineering!

00:29:45.750 --> 00:29:46.739
Mother!

00:29:46.818 --> 00:29:48.718
Her synaptic pathways
are destabilizing!

00:29:48.787 --> 00:29:50.254
Abort the procedure!

00:29:50.321 --> 00:29:51.253
...voices. Help me!

00:29:51.322 --> 00:29:52.448
Abort!

00:29:52.524 --> 00:29:54.048
Stand by, Doctor.

00:29:54.125 --> 00:29:55.786
Power output at 98 percent.

00:29:56.861 --> 00:29:58.226
The force field is collapsing.

00:29:58.296 --> 00:29:59.923
Transfer to emergency power.

00:30:00.064 --> 00:30:01.531
It won't work, Lieutenant.

00:30:01.599 --> 00:30:02.531
We must abort.

00:30:02.600 --> 00:30:03.658
Tuvok to Bridge.

00:30:03.735 --> 00:30:05.794
The procedure was unsuccessful.

00:30:05.870 --> 00:30:08.304
The vinculum has returned
to full power.

00:30:08.373 --> 00:30:09.465
Acknowledged.

00:30:09.541 --> 00:30:10.803
Doctor, report.

00:30:10.875 --> 00:30:13.901
Seven's neural pattern
has disappeared, Captain.

00:30:13.978 --> 00:30:15.946
It appears that...

00:30:16.047 --> 00:30:18.777
the other patterns
have taken over completely.

00:30:18.850 --> 00:30:20.044
We've lost her.

00:30:28.259 --> 00:30:30.284
Captain's Log, supplemental.

00:30:30.361 --> 00:30:32.522
Long-range sensors
have detected a vessel

00:30:32.597 --> 00:30:35.532
belonging to Species 6339.

00:30:35.600 --> 00:30:37.659
We've set a course
to intercept them

00:30:37.735 --> 00:30:40.966
in the hopes they can help us
restore Seven of Nine.

00:30:41.039 --> 00:30:43.599
I've managed to stabilize
her primary cortical functions,

00:30:43.675 --> 00:30:47.076
but the woman in Sick Bay is not
Seven of Nine... not anymore.

00:30:47.145 --> 00:30:49.943
New personalities are emerging
every few seconds now.

00:30:50.014 --> 00:30:50.981
She can't finish a sentence

00:30:51.049 --> 00:30:52.346
before the next one
rears its head.

00:30:52.417 --> 00:30:55.580
It's creating an incredible
strain on her cerebral cortex.

00:30:55.653 --> 00:30:57.177
If we don't deactivate
the vinculum soon,

00:30:57.255 --> 00:30:58.244
we may never get her back.

00:30:58.323 --> 00:30:59.255
Tuvok?

00:30:59.324 --> 00:31:01.258
Lieutenant Torres
is taking measures

00:31:01.326 --> 00:31:03.260
to prevent the vinculum
from adapting,

00:31:03.328 --> 00:31:05.296
but there's no guarantee
she'll succeed.

00:31:05.363 --> 00:31:07.422
Captain, I've exhausted every
viable treatment in my database.

00:31:07.498 --> 00:31:10.524
Then logic dictates
we go beyond medical science.

00:31:10.602 --> 00:31:13.093
I will attempt to mind-meld
with Seven of Nine.

00:31:13.171 --> 00:31:15.833
A mind-meld? You consider that
a viable treatment?

00:31:15.907 --> 00:31:18.034
Seven's neural pattern...
her sense of self...

00:31:18.109 --> 00:31:19.406
is immersed in chaos.

00:31:19.477 --> 00:31:21.468
I will attempt
to isolate her true self

00:31:21.546 --> 00:31:23.241
and guide it to the surface.

00:31:23.314 --> 00:31:24.941
It's dangerous enough
to meld with one person,

00:31:25.016 --> 00:31:27.041
let alone hundreds
of different personalities.

00:31:27.118 --> 00:31:28.050
It's too risky.

00:31:28.119 --> 00:31:29.381
The risk is mine to take.

00:31:29.454 --> 00:31:31.615
I'm aware of that,
but is this our only option?

00:31:31.689 --> 00:31:33.623
I believe it is, Captain.

00:31:33.691 --> 00:31:35.124
How long would you need
to prepare?

00:31:35.193 --> 00:31:36.319
Captain...

00:31:36.394 --> 00:31:37.884
you can't actually be
considering this...

00:31:37.962 --> 00:31:39.589
Vulcan mumbo jumbo.

00:31:39.664 --> 00:31:41.529
I will require
two hours of meditation.

00:31:41.599 --> 00:31:42.964
Begin immediately.

00:31:43.067 --> 00:31:44.728
Report to Sick Bay
when you're ready.

00:31:44.802 --> 00:31:46.292
You said it yourself.

00:31:46.371 --> 00:31:48.271
We've exhausted
every medical treatment.

00:31:48.339 --> 00:31:50.466
I just hope I don't find
myself with a second patient.

00:31:50.541 --> 00:31:51.974
Captain to the Bridge.

00:31:52.043 --> 00:31:53.010
On my way.

00:31:54.979 --> 00:31:55.911
Commander?

00:31:55.980 --> 00:31:58.175
It's them... Species 6339.

00:31:58.249 --> 00:31:59.477
Their vessel is well-armed,
Captain.

00:31:59.550 --> 00:32:02.383
I'm picking up 22 phaser cannons
on the aft section alone.

00:32:02.453 --> 00:32:03.511
Hail them.

00:32:03.588 --> 00:32:04.816
They're responding.

00:32:04.889 --> 00:32:06.356
On screen.

00:32:06.424 --> 00:32:08.790
I'm Captain Janeway

00:32:08.860 --> 00:32:11.328
of the Federation
Starship Voyager.

00:32:11.396 --> 00:32:14.559
We recently found a piece
of Borg technology.

00:32:14.632 --> 00:32:16.827
It's been infected
with a viral agent

00:32:16.901 --> 00:32:18.232
we believe was
transmitted by your...

00:32:18.303 --> 00:32:20.271
The vinculum.
You have it?

00:32:21.339 --> 00:32:22.431
Yes.

00:32:22.507 --> 00:32:26.034
You've made
a terrible mistake, Captain.

00:32:26.110 --> 00:32:27.099
A weapon?

00:32:27.178 --> 00:32:29.043
Yes. Since the Borg
decimated our world,

00:32:29.113 --> 00:32:31.581
we've been looking
for ways to retaliate.

00:32:31.649 --> 00:32:34.675
So you created a virus
to infect their technology.

00:32:34.752 --> 00:32:37.186
13 of my people were
injected with the virus.

00:32:37.255 --> 00:32:39.416
They allowed themselves
to be assimilated

00:32:39.490 --> 00:32:41.958
so that the virus would spread
to this vinculum.

00:32:42.093 --> 00:32:44.118
Once another Borg ship
had retrieved it,

00:32:44.195 --> 00:32:45.856
they would be infected as well.

00:32:45.930 --> 00:32:47.898
Then another cube,
and another...

00:32:47.966 --> 00:32:49.126
We had the opportunity

00:32:49.200 --> 00:32:51.691
to infect dozens, even
hundreds of Borg vessels

00:32:51.769 --> 00:32:53.259
until you interfered!

00:32:53.338 --> 00:32:54.600
Why?

00:32:54.672 --> 00:32:57.732
Your virus has had one
unexpected casualty...

00:32:57.809 --> 00:32:59.367
a member of my crew.

00:32:59.444 --> 00:33:01.810
It wasn't designed
to infect other species.

00:33:01.879 --> 00:33:03.039
She's Borg.

00:33:03.114 --> 00:33:04.638
We liberated her

00:33:04.716 --> 00:33:06.547
from the collective
over a year ago.

00:33:06.617 --> 00:33:07.845
She's an individual now.

00:33:07.919 --> 00:33:10.149
We were hoping you could
help us treat her.

00:33:10.221 --> 00:33:14.681
We designed that virus
to destroy Borg, Captain.

00:33:14.759 --> 00:33:17.250
We never considered a treatment.

00:33:17.328 --> 00:33:20.923
I'm afraid your drone
won't survive,

00:33:21.032 --> 00:33:24.627
but we must return the vinculum
to the debris field immediately.

00:33:24.702 --> 00:33:27.694
If the Borg arrive first,
we'll have lost our chance.

00:33:27.772 --> 00:33:31.037
And those 13 people
will have died in vain.

00:33:32.410 --> 00:33:34.469
All right.
We'll return it to you,

00:33:34.545 --> 00:33:37.571
but first we need to try
to save our crew member.

00:33:37.648 --> 00:33:38.808
We think we have a way

00:33:38.883 --> 00:33:40.817
to counteract
the vinculum's effects.

00:33:40.885 --> 00:33:41.817
B'Elanna?

00:33:41.886 --> 00:33:43.410
I'm going to try to remodulate

00:33:43.488 --> 00:33:45.353
our dampening field
to compensate...

00:33:45.423 --> 00:33:46.856
We don't have time for this.

00:33:46.924 --> 00:33:49.358
The vinculum, Captain.

00:33:49.427 --> 00:33:51.486
I can't give it to you.

00:33:51.562 --> 00:33:52.688
Not yet.

00:33:52.764 --> 00:33:54.561
You've scanned our vessel.

00:33:54.632 --> 00:33:57.294
You're aware of our firepower.

00:33:57.368 --> 00:34:01.702
You could undoubtedly do
significant damage to Voyager

00:34:01.773 --> 00:34:03.502
and to the vinculum.

00:34:03.574 --> 00:34:05.508
Is that what you want?

00:34:06.844 --> 00:34:11.543
The vinculum survived
the destruction of one ship.

00:34:11.616 --> 00:34:15.347
What makes you so sure
it won't survive another?

00:34:26.697 --> 00:34:27.891
Doctor...

00:34:27.965 --> 00:34:28.932
Seven.

00:34:30.635 --> 00:34:32.603
A necessary precaution.

00:34:32.670 --> 00:34:36.128
A few of your... guests
have been violent.

00:34:36.207 --> 00:34:37.401
The vinculum.

00:34:37.475 --> 00:34:38.635
It keeps adapting.

00:34:38.709 --> 00:34:41.143
We haven't been able
to shut it down.

00:34:41.212 --> 00:34:44.909
Your own neural pattern was
nearly destroyed in the process.

00:34:44.982 --> 00:34:47.951
I wasn't sure
I'd find you again.

00:34:48.052 --> 00:34:49.849
I am damaged.

00:34:49.921 --> 00:34:52.355
One of your... personas

00:34:52.423 --> 00:34:54.618
didn't appreciate
the restraints.

00:34:54.692 --> 00:34:57.957
She seemed intent on forcing
her way to freedom.

00:34:58.062 --> 00:34:59.222
I apologize.

00:35:00.498 --> 00:35:02.329
It was hardly your fault.
You're ill.

00:35:02.400 --> 00:35:03.662
Irrelevant.

00:35:03.734 --> 00:35:06.032
I am Borg...
I should be able to adapt.

00:35:06.104 --> 00:35:07.901
Surprise...
you aren't invincible.

00:35:08.005 --> 00:35:10.667
I suppose that's something
we'll have to tackle

00:35:10.741 --> 00:35:12.231
in our next social lesson.

00:35:17.982 --> 00:35:19.244
Voices?

00:35:19.317 --> 00:35:21.376
They're getting louder.

00:35:22.787 --> 00:35:24.914
It won't be long
before I lose you again.

00:35:26.657 --> 00:35:28.249
It's my duty as your physician

00:35:28.326 --> 00:35:30.658
to inform you
of an alternative treatment.

00:35:30.728 --> 00:35:31.786
What treatment?

00:35:31.863 --> 00:35:34.024
Commander Tuvok has
proposed a mind-meld

00:35:34.098 --> 00:35:36.464
to help stabilize
your neural pattern.

00:35:36.534 --> 00:35:37.933
I had a similar reaction.

00:35:38.035 --> 00:35:39.434
If you don't approve...

00:35:39.504 --> 00:35:41.131
What is the probability
of success?

00:35:41.205 --> 00:35:42.638
I don't know.

00:35:42.707 --> 00:35:44.937
A mind-meld is hardly a
standard medical practice.

00:35:45.009 --> 00:35:47.204
Are there any risks to Tuvok?

00:35:47.278 --> 00:35:48.836
He could suffer brain damage,

00:35:48.913 --> 00:35:51.677
but he's confident he'll
be able to break the meld

00:35:51.749 --> 00:35:53.649
before that happens.

00:35:53.718 --> 00:35:55.913
Even if we do
shut down the vinculum,

00:35:55.987 --> 00:35:57.955
it may not be enough.

00:35:58.089 --> 00:36:00.557
If Tuvok can do
anything to help me...

00:36:00.625 --> 00:36:01.922
I understand.

00:36:03.027 --> 00:36:04.824
Doctor...

00:36:04.896 --> 00:36:08.229
you have shown
a great deal of patience.

00:36:08.299 --> 00:36:09.994
Not at all.

00:36:10.067 --> 00:36:14.663
Inform the crew that I am
also grateful for their efforts.

00:36:14.739 --> 00:36:17.401
You'll be able
to tell them yourself afterward.

00:36:19.010 --> 00:36:19.908
Seven!

00:36:20.011 --> 00:36:21.103
Voices!

00:36:21.179 --> 00:36:22.441
Concentrate.

00:36:23.981 --> 00:36:25.915
Focus on the sound of my voice.

00:36:25.983 --> 00:36:27.780
Get them out, please!

00:36:29.020 --> 00:36:30.044
I can't...

00:36:31.589 --> 00:36:32.851
I can't...

00:36:32.924 --> 00:36:35.552
No! No!

00:36:54.345 --> 00:36:55.403
Report.

00:36:55.479 --> 00:36:57.413
The alien vessel
is coming about.

00:36:57.481 --> 00:36:58.948
They're charging weapons.

00:36:59.016 --> 00:37:00.608
Shields.

00:37:05.523 --> 00:37:07.548
As if the meld weren't
dangerous enough,

00:37:07.625 --> 00:37:10.389
the aliens are trying
to take the vinculum by force.

00:37:10.461 --> 00:37:12.224
Commander Chakotay
is at tactical.

00:37:12.296 --> 00:37:13.991
The Captain wants
you here with Seven.

00:37:14.065 --> 00:37:16.499
This will allow me
to monitor your neural activity

00:37:16.567 --> 00:37:18.000
for the duration of the meld.

00:37:18.069 --> 00:37:19.536
At the first sign of trouble...

00:37:19.604 --> 00:37:20.696
You will do nothing.

00:37:20.771 --> 00:37:22.033
I beg your pardon?

00:37:22.106 --> 00:37:24.438
There will undoubtedly be
many signs of trouble.

00:37:24.508 --> 00:37:26.908
You must have faith
in my ability to endure them.

00:37:27.011 --> 00:37:28.569
I'll try.
I just hope my faith

00:37:28.646 --> 00:37:30.910
doesn't leave the two of you
brain-damaged.

00:37:30.982 --> 00:37:32.916
Your concerns
have been noted, Doctor.

00:37:33.050 --> 00:37:35.541
With all of these new
personalities floating around,

00:37:35.620 --> 00:37:37.520
it's a shame
we can't find one for you.

00:37:37.588 --> 00:37:39.852
Computer, deactivate
force field.

00:37:43.661 --> 00:37:45.595
Why am I tied to this bed?

00:37:45.663 --> 00:37:48.188
Please let me go.

00:37:48.266 --> 00:37:50.700
Pahtk!

00:37:50.768 --> 00:37:52.861
I'll rip out your throat,
coward!

00:37:55.339 --> 00:37:56.533
Name your price.

00:37:56.607 --> 00:37:57.938
Ten bars of latinum?

00:37:58.075 --> 00:37:59.633
Twenty?

00:37:59.710 --> 00:38:02.201
This isn't medicine.
It's torture!

00:38:02.280 --> 00:38:04.145
I'll sue for malpractice!

00:38:05.816 --> 00:38:09.343
I fail to see the logic
in this meld, Commander.

00:38:09.420 --> 00:38:10.819
My mind to your mind.

00:38:10.888 --> 00:38:12.515
You are but one mind
confronting thousands.

00:38:12.590 --> 00:38:14.319
My thoughts to your thoughts.

00:38:14.392 --> 00:38:16.383
You will not succeed.

00:38:16.460 --> 00:38:17.893
Your mind to my mind.

00:38:17.995 --> 00:38:19.189
Let me go.

00:38:19.263 --> 00:38:20.195
My mind to your mind.

00:38:20.264 --> 00:38:21.356
The Borg are
assimilating the ship!

00:38:21.432 --> 00:38:22.364
We've got to evacuate.

00:38:22.433 --> 00:38:23.365
My thoughts
to your thoughts.

00:38:23.434 --> 00:38:24.731
- Listen to me!!
- My mind to your mind.

00:38:24.802 --> 00:38:26.030
They're trying
to assimilate the ship!

00:38:26.103 --> 00:38:27.035
Let me go!

00:38:27.104 --> 00:38:29.095
My thoughts to your thoughts.

00:38:29.173 --> 00:38:31.164
Where's my mommy? Mommy!

00:38:31.242 --> 00:38:33.676
My mind to your mind.

00:38:33.744 --> 00:38:34.711
Mommy...

00:38:34.779 --> 00:38:39.409
My thoughts to your thoughts.

00:38:44.288 --> 00:38:45.653
Seven?

00:38:50.728 --> 00:38:52.457
Seven!

00:38:58.169 --> 00:38:59.227
Seven!

00:39:07.011 --> 00:39:08.911
Seven!

00:39:12.983 --> 00:39:14.177
Seven!

00:39:22.727 --> 00:39:24.092
Seven!

00:39:25.930 --> 00:39:26.919
Seven!

00:39:34.305 --> 00:39:36.170
I'm lost! Somebody help me!

00:39:36.240 --> 00:39:38.265
Please! I don't like it here!

00:39:38.342 --> 00:39:39.604
I want to go home!

00:39:39.677 --> 00:39:40.666
I can't find my...

00:39:40.745 --> 00:39:42.872
Mommy! Please! Help me!

00:39:42.947 --> 00:39:45.279
Please! I don't
want to stay here!

00:39:45.349 --> 00:39:47.010
I want to go home!
I don't like it!

00:39:47.084 --> 00:39:49.450
Please help me!
I want to go home!

00:39:49.520 --> 00:39:52.887
These people are scary!
Please don't go!

00:39:52.957 --> 00:39:54.788
Please! Why are you
leaving me here?!

00:39:54.859 --> 00:39:56.417
Don't go!

00:39:56.494 --> 00:39:58.962
Please! I don't like it here!

00:40:02.633 --> 00:40:03.759
Sick Bay to Engineering.

00:40:03.834 --> 00:40:05.768
How long until the vinculum's
off-line?

00:40:05.836 --> 00:40:08.464
Two, maybe three minutes...

00:40:08.539 --> 00:40:11.809
provided Voyager can stay
in one piece for that long.

00:40:15.813 --> 00:40:17.644
Shields down to 60 percent.

00:40:17.715 --> 00:40:18.841
Evasive maneuvers.

00:40:18.916 --> 00:40:20.850
Target their
weapons array.

00:40:20.918 --> 00:40:23.113
Targeting systems
are malfunctioning.

00:40:23.187 --> 00:40:25.883
We're losing power
to main thrusters.

00:40:25.956 --> 00:40:27.082
Shields to 35 percent.

00:40:27.158 --> 00:40:29.217
Reroute all available
power to shields.

00:40:29.293 --> 00:40:31.227
Chakotay, initiate
manual targeting.

00:40:31.295 --> 00:40:32.762
Torres to Bridge.

00:40:32.830 --> 00:40:34.491
The vinculum's stopped adapting.

00:40:34.565 --> 00:40:36.760
I think the new dampening field
is working.

00:40:36.834 --> 00:40:39.462
We should have it disabled
in the next 60 seconds.

00:40:39.537 --> 00:40:42.563
Warning. Neurochemical synapses
are destabilizing.

00:40:42.640 --> 00:40:44.608
Computer, increase power
to the cortical inhibitors.

00:40:44.675 --> 00:40:47.735
Unable to comply. Power
transport systems are off-line.

00:40:47.812 --> 00:40:50.246
Tuvok, if you can hear me,
we have to terminate the meld.

00:40:50.314 --> 00:40:52.179
Tuvok! Tuvok!

00:40:53.384 --> 00:40:55.352
Le'raH tuH me'roQ.

00:41:09.700 --> 00:41:11.190
Commander?

00:41:13.103 --> 00:41:14.468
Commander?

00:41:22.446 --> 00:41:23.470
Seven!

00:41:23.547 --> 00:41:25.105
Commander?

00:41:30.254 --> 00:41:31.721
Seven!

00:41:31.789 --> 00:41:34.883
Power output's down
to 29 percent.

00:41:34.959 --> 00:41:37.052
22... 17...

00:41:41.131 --> 00:41:43.122
Bridge, we just lost
the field emitters.

00:41:43.200 --> 00:41:45.464
We took a direct hit
to the power grid.

00:41:45.536 --> 00:41:48.334
Stand by. We're switching
to emergency backup.

00:41:58.315 --> 00:41:59.475
Seven!

00:42:04.255 --> 00:42:06.450
Bridge, the vinculum's
powering up again.

00:42:06.524 --> 00:42:08.924
The field emitters
are back on line.

00:42:09.026 --> 00:42:09.993
Pull the plug.

00:42:13.197 --> 00:42:14.528
It's working.

00:42:14.598 --> 00:42:18.056
Power output down to 19 percent.

00:42:18.135 --> 00:42:19.932
13 percent.

00:42:22.106 --> 00:42:23.733
Seven!

00:42:26.610 --> 00:42:28.100
Seven!

00:42:28.178 --> 00:42:30.373
Tuvok!

00:42:30.447 --> 00:42:31.846
Seven!

00:42:33.417 --> 00:42:35.078
It's done, Captain.

00:42:35.152 --> 00:42:36.779
The vinculum's off-line.

00:42:52.236 --> 00:42:54.329
Seven?

00:42:54.405 --> 00:42:56.270
Yes.

00:42:56.340 --> 00:42:57.864
We have her back, Captain.

00:42:57.942 --> 00:42:58.966
Hail the lead vessel.

00:42:59.109 --> 00:43:00.940
Tell them we're surrendering
the vinculum.

00:43:02.746 --> 00:43:04.714
No response.

00:43:04.782 --> 00:43:06.443
Lock onto the damn thing.

00:43:06.517 --> 00:43:07.814
Beam it into space.

00:43:10.521 --> 00:43:12.614
Transport complete.

00:43:14.258 --> 00:43:16.283
They're withdrawing.

00:43:16.360 --> 00:43:18.760
Take us out of here, Tom.
Warp 9.

00:43:18.829 --> 00:43:20.023
Yes, ma'am.

00:43:22.666 --> 00:43:26.625
Captain's Log, Stardate 52356.2.

00:43:26.704 --> 00:43:29.138
After nearly a week
of regeneration,

00:43:29.206 --> 00:43:32.733
Seven of Nine has finally
recovered from her ordeal.

00:43:34.912 --> 00:43:38.905
Neuroprocessor, cortical
receptors, all stable.

00:43:38.983 --> 00:43:40.473
She's fit to return to duty.

00:43:40.551 --> 00:43:42.314
What about her
other personalities?

00:43:42.386 --> 00:43:43.410
Any sign of them?

00:43:43.487 --> 00:43:44.579
Those neural patterns

00:43:44.655 --> 00:43:46.646
have returned
to their dormant state.

00:43:46.724 --> 00:43:49.090
The voices will not return?

00:43:50.394 --> 00:43:52.760
I suppose that depends
on your perspective.

00:43:52.830 --> 00:43:53.956
You may not hear them,

00:43:54.064 --> 00:43:56.362
but I suspect
they'll always be with you.

00:43:59.903 --> 00:44:04.499
The members of this crew put
themselves at risk to help me.

00:44:04.575 --> 00:44:07.476
I am unsure how to reciprocate.

00:44:07.544 --> 00:44:09.409
Let's start
with something small.

00:44:09.480 --> 00:44:12.074
Like a recalibration
of the EPS manifolds?

00:44:12.149 --> 00:44:14.447
B'Elanna's expecting
you in Engineering.

00:44:14.518 --> 00:44:16.713
I will join her shortly.

00:44:16.787 --> 00:44:20.484
There is a crew member
I must see first.

00:44:24.695 --> 00:44:26.253
These are star charts for
the next three systems

00:44:26.330 --> 00:44:27.490
Voyager will pass through.

00:44:27.564 --> 00:44:28.758
Familiarize yourself with them.

00:44:28.832 --> 00:44:29.924
Understood.

00:44:30.034 --> 00:44:33.060
Sociological data regarding
173 Delta Quadrant species.

00:44:33.137 --> 00:44:34.069
Study it.

00:44:34.138 --> 00:44:35.366
I will.

00:44:35.439 --> 00:44:36.371
As Bridge Assistant,

00:44:36.440 --> 00:44:37.839
you will find
this information relevant.

00:44:37.908 --> 00:44:39.933
Consider it "assimilated."

00:44:40.010 --> 00:44:41.875
There is one more assignment.

00:44:41.945 --> 00:44:44.539
I require your assistance.

00:44:44.615 --> 00:44:46.242
Me?

00:44:46.316 --> 00:44:50.343
I wish to participate
in recreational activities.

00:44:50.421 --> 00:44:51.888
Great.

00:44:53.590 --> 00:44:55.148
Kadis-Kot.

00:44:55.225 --> 00:44:57.819
Instruct me how to play.

00:44:57.895 --> 00:44:59.795
I will comply.
